<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">- TarifitLS</book>
  <para style="h">2 Timutawus</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Tim</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Timutawus</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ṯabrat wis ṯnayen n arrasul Bulus ɣar Timutawus</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ṯabrat wis ṯnayen n arrasul Bulus ɣar Timutawus</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1" />
  <para style="s">Lmuqaddima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1" />Nec ḏ Bulus ḏ ijjen n arrasul n Ƹisa Lmasiḥ s ȓxaḍar n Arebbi ƹlaḥsab lwaƹeḏ nni iy ḏaneɣ iwƹeḏ x ṯuḏarṯ nni iǧan ḏi Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="2TI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2" /><char style="it">Tariɣ ṯabrat-a</char> i Timutawus wenni iy iǧan am memmi iƹizzen xafi. Akiḏec yiȓi arḍa ḏ ȓehna ḏ arraḥmeṯ zi Arebbi Babaṯneɣ ḏ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ Siḏiṯneɣ.<verse eid="2TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3" />Tcekkareɣ Arebbi wenni ƹebbḏeɣ zi ȓejḏuḏ inu s yijjen n ḍḍamir iṣfan. Tettareɣ-as i Arebbi xac ǧiȓeṯ ḏ nhar bȓa ma aḏ beddeɣ. <verse eid="2TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4" />Xmi tfekkareɣ ḏeg imeṭṭawen nnec iteṭṭef-ayi-d ijjen n mezȓi ac ẓreɣ ḥima aḏ ƹemmareɣ s ȓefraḥeṯ. <verse eid="2TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5" />Ƹeqȓeɣ x lʼiman nnec bȓa nnifaq wenni iǧan ḏ amezwaru ḏi ḥennac Lwiza ḏ yemmac Anisa. Ȓexxu teyyqeɣ ḏ ṣṣaḥ belli aqaṯ ḏayec uȓa ḏ cek.<verse eid="2TI 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lqudra nni iy yuca Arebbi i Timutawus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6" />X manaya ac fekkareɣ bac aḏ tsenhezzeḏ lqudra nni iy ḏayec iǧan zi Arebbi ƹlaḥsab wami xac serseɣ ifassen inu. <verse eid="2TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7" />Aqa Arebbi war ḏaneɣ yuci ca ijjen n arruḥ n ṯiggwḏi; Lla, qa yuca-aneɣ-d ijjen arruḥ n jjheḏ ḏ ȓemḥibbeṯ ḏ ȓeḥkam x yixef nneɣ s ȓaƹqeȓ. <verse eid="2TI 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8" />Iḏen war tseḏḥa ca aḏ tcehḏeḏ x Siḏiṯneɣ niɣ xafi nec iy iǧan ḏ ameḥbus ƹlaḥsab netta; Lla, qebbeȓ aƹeddeb nni iǧan ƹlaḥsab Lʼinjil, s jjheḏ n Arebbi. <verse eid="2TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9" />Isenjem-aneɣ iȓaɣa-yaneɣ-d s yijjen n uȓaɣi muqeddes. War ḏaneɣ d iȓaɣi ca ƹlaḥsab lḥasanaṯ nneɣ; Lla, iȓaɣa-yaneɣ-d ƹlaḥsab lɣaraḍ nnes netta ḏ arḍa nnes iy ḏaneɣ d yuca ḏi Ƹisa Lmasiḥ qbeȓ ma aḏ tebḏa ȓweqṯ <char style="it">n ddunect-a</char> qaƹ. <verse eid="2TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10" />Arḍa-ya qa imeḍhar-d ȓexxu wami d imeḍhar Ƹisa Lmasiḥ wenni iy ḏaneɣ isenjamen wenni isbeṭṭȓen ȓmewṯ. Ȓexxu s ufus n Lʼinjil yuwi-d ṯuḏarṯ ɣar nnur ḏ ṯenni war ifennin ca. <verse eid="2TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11" />Ƹlaḥsab Lʼinjil-a twaxḍareɣ nec aḏ beccareɣ aḏ iȓiɣ ḏ arrasul ḏ ijjen n umseȓmaḏ. <verse eid="2TI 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12" />X ssabab-a nec qa tƹeddabeɣ x marra ṯimesȓayin-a ṯina walakin war tseḏḥiɣ ca, nec ssneɣ wenni iy zi umneɣ. Teyyqeɣ netta izemmar aḏ iḥḍa lʼamana nni iy kiḏes jjiɣ ḥetta aȓ Nhar nni <char style="it">aneggaru</char>.<verse eid="2TI 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13" />Meṯṯel ttaƹlim nni nican iy ṯesȓiḏ zzayi, akiḏes iy ɣa yiȓi ijjen n lʼiman ḏ yijjen n ȓemḥibbeṯ iy iǧan ḏi Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="2TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14" />Ḥḍa ṯamesȓayṯ nni iy ḏac ijja ḏ lʼamana, ḥḍa-t s Arruḥ iqeddsen iy ḏayneɣ izeddɣen.<verse eid="2TI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lmiṯal n umaṯneɣ Wanisfur</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15" />Cek ṯessneḏ belli marra yinni iǧan ḏi lʼiqlim n Asya semḥen ḏayi uȓa ḏ Fixulus ḏ Hirmujinus.<verse eid="2TI 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16" />Aḏ ibarek Siḏi Arebbi ȓeḥbab n umaṯneɣ Wanisfur, aṭṭas n ṯwaȓaṯin isertaḥ-ayi war iseḏḥi ca x snaseȓ inu. <verse eid="2TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17" />Lla, netta wami iǧa ḏi ṯendint n Ruma irezzu xafi aṭṭas aȓ wami iy ḏayi yufa. <verse eid="2TI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18" />Aṯ ijj Siḏiṯneɣ ḥima aḏ yaf arraḥmeṯ zi Siḏi Arebbi ḏi Nhar nni <char style="it">aneggaru</char>. Cek ƹaweḏ ṯessneḏ mecḥaȓ n ṯwaȓaṯin iy ḏayi iƹawen ḏi ṯendint n Ufasus.<verse eid="2TI 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2" />
  <para style="s">Axeddam n Lmasiḥ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1" />Iḏen fa cek a mmi, sjehheḏ ixef nnec ḏi arḍa nni iǧan ḏi Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="2TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2" />Ṯimesȓayin nni iy ṯesȓiḏ zzayi zzaṯ i waṭṭas n ȓechuḏ, ejj-iṯent am yijjen n lʼamana ak iryazen ataf ḏaysen ttiqeṯ, ƹaweḏ iryazen nni zemmaren aḏ sȓemḏen iwḏan nneɣni. <verse eid="2TI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3" />Iȓi <char style="it">akiḏi</char> ḏeg uƹeddeb am uƹeskari aṣebḥan n Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="2TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4" />War ḏinni bu can uƹeskari ig itemxumburen ḏi ddur nnes ḏi ṯmesȓayin n ddunect-a ȓaḥeqqac irezzu aḏ yarḍa x wenni iy ṯ yarrin ḏ aƹeskari. <verse eid="2TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5" />Amenni ƹaweḏ wenni itemƹanaḏen ḏi lmelƹab; Meȓa war itemƹanaḏ ca ƹlaḥsab lqanun war irebbeḥ ca ljaʼiza. <verse eid="2TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6" />Afeǧaḥ ig itamaren ḏi ȓxeḏmeṯ u labud aḏ iysi ȓḥaqq nnes netta ḏ amezwaru zi ṯfeǧaḥṯ nni. <verse eid="2TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7" />Fekkar ḏi min ḏac qqareɣ, aqa ḏ Siḏi Arebbi netta iy c ɣa isefhamen ḏi marra ṯimesȓayin-a.<verse eid="2TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8" />Fekkar ḏi Ƹisa Lmasiḥ wenni iy d isekkar Arebbi zi ȓmewṯ, netta lʼaṣel nnes zi Dawed. Ḏ manaya ig iǧan ḏi Lʼinjil iy tbeccareɣ nec. <verse eid="2TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9" />X Lʼinjil-a iy twaƹeddabeɣ nec qennen-ayi s snaseȓ am yijjen n lmujrim. Walakin awaȓen n Arebbi lla, war zemmaren aṯen qennen s snaseȓ. <verse eid="2TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10" />X manaya nec ṣebbareɣ x marra ṯimesȓayin ƹlaḥsab yinni itwaxḍaren ḥima uȓa ḏ yina aḏ nejjmen s ufus n Ƹisa Lmasiḥ, akiḏes ijjen lƹaḍama iy war ifennin ca.<verse eid="2TI 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11" />Aqa ijjen wawaȓ ḏayes ttiqeṯ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:11">
    <char style="bd">Meȓa nemmuṯ akiḏes, </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:11">
    <char style="bd">uca a neddar akiḏes. </char><verse eid="2TI 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12" />
    <char style="bd">Meȓa neṣbar, </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">
    <char style="bd">uca a neḥkem akiḏes. </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:12">
    <char style="bd">Meȓa nenkar-iṯ, </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">
    <char style="bd">uca ƹaweḏ netta aḏaneɣ inkar. </char><verse eid="2TI 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13" />
    <char style="bd">Meȓa nesmeḥ neccin ḏi lʼamana nneɣ, </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">
    <char style="bd">maci aḏ ismeḥ netta ḏi lʼamana nnes, </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">
    <char style="bd">minzi war izemmar aḏ inkar ixef nnes. </char><verse eid="2TI 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Axeddam nni iǧan nican n Siḏi Arebbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14" />Sfekkar ȓmuminin x ṯmesȓayin-a. Ƹȓem-asen zzaṯ i Arebbi bac war tmenɣin ca x wawaȓen. Amenɣi nni war ḏayes walu, ɣir aḏ isufeɣ zeg ubriḏ yinni itsȓan. <verse eid="2TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15" />Egg lmejhud nnec bac aḏ tseḥḍareḏ ixef nnec ɣar Arebbi am yijjen ɣares iǧan meqbul, iƹni am yijjen n uxeddam war ɣares minxef iy ɣa iseḏḥa itfessar nican awaȓ n lḥaqiqa.<verse eid="2TI 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16" />Fa awggwej zeg wawaȓen nni ixwan n yiwḏan n ddunect-a minzi awaȓen nsen aḏ arnin ɣir ḏi ȓeqfaȓeṯ nsen x Arebbi. <verse eid="2TI 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17" />Awaȓ nsen aḏ iɣezz ḏeg uysum am ȓehrac n ssaraṭan, zzaysen Ḥimmit ḏ Filitus. <verse eid="2TI 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18" />Niṯni ffɣen abriḏ n lḥaqiqa qqaren qa ṣafi Yum Lqiyama iwqeƹ, tḍeyyaƹen lʼiman n ȓebƹaḍ n yiwḏan. <verse eid="2TI 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19" />Walakin dsas ijehḏen n Arebbi war itenhezzi ca, xas iy neqcent ṯira-ya qqarent qa Siḏi Arebbi qa issen iwḏan iǧan nnes. Qqarent ƹaweḏ qa marra yinni icehhḏen s yisem n Siḏiṯneɣ itxeṣṣa u labud aḏ beƹƹḏen x ccarr.<verse eid="2TI 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20" />Cuf, ijjen n ṯeddarṯ ṯaṣebḥant war ḏayes ca ɣir ȓeqcuƹ n ddheb niɣ ḏ nnuqarṯ waha; Lla, ḏayes uȓa ḏ ȓeqcuƹ n ukeccuḍ ḏ ucaȓ. Ȓebƹaḍiṯ twasteƹmalen i min iǧan ḏ ccan, ȓebƹaḍiṯ twasteƹmalen i min iǧan ƹadi waha. <verse eid="2TI 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21" />Wenni issiṣfan ixef nnes zi marra ṯimesȓayin nni ṯiƹeffanin ataf aḏ yiȓi am ȓeqcuƹ nni iy twasteƹmalen i min iǧan ḏ ccan, netta aḏ yiȓi iṣfa aḏ yiȓi ineffeƹ i Bab nnes, aḏ yiȓi iwjeḏ i kuȓ ȓxeḏmeṯ ṯaṣebḥant.<verse eid="2TI 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22" />Fa arweȓ zi ccahawaṯ nni ṯiƹeffanin n ṯemẓi, ḏeffar ṣṣulḥ ḏ lʼiman ḏ ȓemḥibbeṯ ḏ ȓehna ak yinni iy d iȓaɣan x Siḏiṯneɣ s yijjen n wuȓ iṣfa. <verse eid="2TI 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23" />Awggwej zeg umnaqar nni iy ḏi iǧa ɣir ṯubuhȓiya ḏ ȓeqfaȓeṯ waha minzi ṯessneḏ belli itarew ɣir amenɣi u ṣafi.<verse eid="2TI 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24" />Fa axeddam n Siḏiṯneɣ labud war itmenɣi ca s wawaȓ aṭṭas; Itxeṣṣa-as aḏ yiȓi ḍrif ak marra iwḏan, ataf issen aḏ iseȓmeḏ, ataf ɣares ttasiƹ n ȓxaḍar. <verse eid="2TI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25" />Aḏ iṣeḥḥaḥ s yijjen n wuȓ iṣebbaren i yinni iy ḏas itƹarraḍen; ḥima meȓa ixes Arebbi aṯen ijj aḏ tuben aḏ ssnen lḥaqiqa. <verse eid="2TI 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26" />Uca aḏ d arren ȓbaȓ nsen aḏ arewȓen zi ṯexcebṯ n Ibȓis wenni iy ṯen iḥebbsen ḥima aḏ ggen ȓxaḍar nnes.<verse eid="2TI 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1" />Fa labud itxeṣṣa aḏ tfehmeḏ belli ussan ineggura aḏ iȓin qeṣḥen. <verse eid="2TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2" />Qa iwḏan aḏ texsen ixef nsen, aḏ texsen tmenyaṯ, aḏaysen yiȓi ttakebbur, aḏ semɣaren ixef nsen, aḏ ssiwȓen awaȓ war iḥȓin x Arebbi. War tṭiƹin ca i lwalidin nsen, war tcekkaren ḥadd, war tiȓin ca ṣfan, <verse eid="2TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3" />war ḏaysen tiȓi ȓemḥibbeṯ, war semmḥen ca i yiwḏan, aḏ qqaren ȓbaṭeȓ, war ḥekkmen ca x yixef nsen, aḏ menɣen am ȓuḥuc, war tḥibbin ca min iǧan ḏ aṣebḥan, <verse eid="2TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4" />aḏ zzenzen ayṯmaṯsen, aḏ ggen ṯimesȓayin bȓa ȓaƹqeȓ, aḏ uffen s nfaxeṯ, aḏ ḥibben ccehweṯ nsen war tḥibbin ca Arebbi, <verse eid="2TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5" />aḏ ggen ixef nsen ƹebbḏen Arebbi walakin nekkaren jjheḏ nnes. Iwḏan-a, awggwej xasen.<verse eid="2TI 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6" />Iryazen-a ḏ yina iy d isnuquben ṯuḏrin am ibbuƹen taḏfen bac aḏ sayṭaren x ṯemɣarin iy ḏi ṯeǧa niyyeṯ tƹemmarent s ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ twacemmaṯent s waṭṭas n lʼanwaƹ n ccahawaṯ. <verse eid="2TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7" />Ȓebda tesȓant ɣar ttaƹlim walakin ƹemmarṣ aḏ awḍent aḏ ssnent lḥaqiqa. <verse eid="2TI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8" />Mammec Yanis ḏ Yampris nni tƹarraḍen i Musa, amenni ƹaweḏ uȓa ḏ iryazen-a tƹarraḍen i lḥaqiqa. Ȓaƹquȓaṯ nsen ƹewwjen, lʼiman nsen ixwa. <verse eid="2TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9" />Walakin iryazen-a war tiwḍen ca mani. Qa aḏasen ṯewqeƹ mamc ḏasen ṯewqeƹ i Yanis ḏ Yampris nni, ṯubuhȓiya n iryazen-a aḏ d tmeḍhar i marra iwḏan.<verse eid="2TI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lmiṯal nni iticc arrasul Bulus i Timutawus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10" />Walakin cek ṯessneḏ mliḥ ttaƹlim inu ḏ ubriḏ n ṯuḏarṯ inu ḏ lɣaraḍ inu ḏ lʼiman inu ḏ ttasiƹ n ȓxaḍar inu ḏ ȓemḥibbeṯ inu ḏ ṣṣbar inu <verse eid="2TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11" />ḏ uƹeddeb inu ḏ tamara inu. Ṯessneḏ min ḏayi iweqƹen ḏi ṯendint n Wanṭakya ḏ Ikunya ḏ Listra ḏ min twaƹeddbeɣ ḏeg imucan nni. Innama, isefȓeṯ-ayi-d Siḏiṯneɣ zi marra manayenni. <verse eid="2TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12" />Ḏ ṣṣaḥ, marra wenni iy irezzun aḏ iƹic s lʼiman iǧan ḏi Ƹisa Lmasiḥ qa aḏ itwaƹeddeb. <verse eid="2TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13" />Amma iryazen iƹeffanen ḏ iryazen icemmaṯen niṯni aḏ arnin ḏi ṯuƹuffna waha, niṯni aḏ cemmṯen aḏ twacemmṯen.<verse eid="2TI 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14" />Cek lla, arni ḏi min ḏac sȓemḏen ḏ min c iseqnaƹen minzi ṯessneḏ yinni iy ḏac isȓemḏen manayenni. <verse eid="2TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15" />Aqa zi ṯemẓi nnec ṯessneḏ ƹaweḏ Ṯira iǧan Muqeddsin zemmarent ac d arrent ḏ miɣis ƹlaḥsab mamc iy ɣa ṯnejmeḏ s lʼiman nni iy iǧan ḏi Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="2TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16" />Aqa marra Ṯira Muqeddsin usint-id zi Arruḥ n Arebbi, neffƹent ḥima azzaysent nseȓmeḏ azzaysent nenha azzaysent nṣeḥḥeḥ azzaysent nrebba ƹlaḥsab ṣṣulḥ. <verse eid="2TI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17" />Ḥima aryaz n Arebbi aḏ yiȓi iwjeḏ aḏ yaf iḏebbar-as s qaƹ ṯimesȓayin ƹlaḥsab kuȓ ȓxeḏmeṯ ḏ ṯaṣebḥant.<verse eid="2TI 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4" />
  <para style="s">Arrasul Bulus itweṣṣa Timutawus ḏi ȓxeḏmeṯ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1" />Acek weṣṣiɣ zzaṯ i Arebbi ḏ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ wenni iy ɣa iḥekmen x yinni iddaren ḏ yinni immuṯen, acek weṣṣiɣ ƹaweḏ ḏi ȓmulk nnes ḏ Nhar nni iy ḏi d ɣa imeḍhar: <verse eid="2TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2" />Beccar awaȓ n Arebbi, sewjeḏ ixef nnec <char style="it">aḏ tbeccareḏ</char> ḏi ȓweqṯ nni iy trajiḏ niɣ ḏi ȓweqṯ nni iy war trijiḏ ca. Ȓmuminin nha-ṯen, ƹȓem-asen, cejjeƹ-iṯen s marra ttasiƹ n ȓxaḍar ḏ useȓmeḏ. <verse eid="2TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3" />Aqa aḏ d tas ȓweqṯ nni niṯni war tṣenniṭen ca ɣar ttaƹlim nican; aɣarsen d smunen ijjen n lƹadad n imseȓmaḏen ssawaȓen ɣir min ḏasen iƹejben i imejjan nsen waha. <verse eid="2TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4" />Yina aḏ sbeƹƹḏen imejjan nsen zi lḥaqiqa aṯen awin aḏ sȓen i ṯḥuja waha. <verse eid="2TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5" />Cek arr-d ȓbaȓ nnec ḏi marra ṯimesȓayin, ṣbar i tamara, egg ȓxeḏmeṯ am wenni itbeccaren, egg lwajib n ȓxeḏmeṯ nnec.<verse eid="2TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6" />Cuf, nec tferraɣen-ayi-d am yijjen n ṣṣeḏqeṯ n iḏammen x dbiḥeṯ itwaqeddamen, aqa ṯuweḍ-d ȓweqṯ n ufuɣ inu <char style="it">zi ddunect-a</char>. <verse eid="2TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7" />Amenɣi-ya aṣebḥan menɣeɣ-ṯ, ṯazzȓa-ya kemmȓeɣ-t, lʼiman ḥḍiɣ-ṯ. <verse eid="2TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8" />Ssa aȓ ṯsawent itraja-ayi ijjen n ttaj n ṣṣulḥ ag Arebbi wenni iy ḏayi ɣa yuc Siḏiṯneɣ iy iǧan ḏ lqaḍi nican; Aḏayi-ṯ yuc ḏi Nhar nni <char style="it">n Lḥisab</char>. Maci aḏayi-ṯ yuc i nec waha; Lla, aṯ yuc i marra yinni itexsen Nhar nni iy ḏi d ɣa imeḍhar.<verse eid="2TI 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Awaȓen ineggura n arrasul Bulus i Timutawus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9" />Egg lmejhud nnec bac aɣari d taseḏ ḏeɣya. <verse eid="2TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10" />Minzi Dimas ismeḥ ḏayi ṯuwi-ṯ ȓemḥibbeṯ n ddunect-a iruḥ ɣar ṯendint n Salunik. Iruḥ Kriskus ɣar lʼiqlim n Galaṭya, iruḥ Titus ɣar jjiheṯ n Dalmasya. <verse eid="2TI 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11" />Iqqim akiḏi ɣir Luqa waha. Awi-d akiḏec Marqus minzi ineffeƹ-ayi ḏi ȓxeḏmeṯ inu. <verse eid="2TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12" />Ssekkeɣ Tuciq ɣar ṯendint n Ufasus. <verse eid="2TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13" />Xmi d ɣa ṯaseḏ, awi-d akiḏec azeǧab inu wenni iy jjiɣ ak Karpus ḏi ṯendint n Traws uȓa ḏ lkutub inu xaṣṣatan yinni iǧan n iȓemawen.<verse eid="2TI 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14" />Iskander wenni itṣennaƹen nneḥḥas iḍarr-ayi aṭṭas, aṯ ixeǧes Arebbi x ȓefƹayeȓ nnes. <verse eid="2TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15" />Uȓa ḏ cek ḥḍa ixef nnec zzayes minzi netta itƹarraḍ aṭṭas i min netbeccar.<verse eid="2TI 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16" />Wami ḏafƹeɣ x yixef inu ṯwaȓa ṯamezwarut ḏi lmaḥkama marra semḥen ḏayi uȓa ḏ ijjen ma ibedd akiḏi. War xasen t itḥisib ca Siḏi Arebbi. <verse eid="2TI 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17" />Ḏ Siḏiṯneɣ iy kiḏi ibedden ɣar uɣezḏis inu yuca-ayi jjheḏ ḥima zzayi nec aḏ itwabeccar Lʼinjil ikmaȓ aṯ sȓen marra yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil, ssenni nec feȓṯeɣ zeg uqemmum n ssbaƹ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ssbaƹ netta ḏ ayraḏ, s ṯeƹrabṯ al-asad.</char></note> <verse eid="2TI 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18" />Aḏayi isefȓeṯ Siḏiṯneɣ zi mkuȓ ṯamesȓayṯ ḏ ṯaƹeffant aḏayi isenjem ɣar ȓmulk nnes iǧan ḏeg ujenna. Aɣares ṯiȓi lƹaḍama i ȓebda n ȓebdaṯ. Amin.<verse eid="2TI 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lxitam n ṯebrat-a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19" />Siweḍ-as sȓam i Priskila ḏ Wakilas ḏ ṯedḏarṯ n Wanisfur. <verse eid="2TI 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20" />Iqqim Arisṭus ḏi ṯendint n Kurinṯ, Trifumu jjiɣ-ṯ nec ḏi ṯendint n Militus ihȓec. <verse eid="2TI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21" />Egg lmejhud nnec bac aḏ d taseḏ qbeȓ i ȓmecta-ya. Isawwaḍ-ac-d sȓam Yubulus uȓa ḏ Buden ḏ Linus ḏ <char style="it">učmaṯneɣ</char> Kludya ḏ marra ayṯmaṯneɣ.<verse eid="2TI 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22" />Aḏ yiȓi Siḏiṯneɣ ak arruḥ nnec. Aḏ yiȓi arḍa akiḏwem marra.<verse eid="2TI 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4" />
</usx>